WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.132
A model should be evaluated on data it did not use for learning.

00:00:04.132 --> 00:00:08.182
Make_classification creates a small synthetic dataset.

00:00:08.182 --> 00:00:15.752
Train_test_split then places seventy-five percent of the rows in the training set and twenty-five percent in the test

00:00:15.752 --> 00:00:21.067
set. With eighty rows total, that gives sixty training rows and twenty test rows.

00:00:21.838 --> 00:00:29.350
Random_state keeps the split reproducible so we get the same rows each time we run the example.

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:33.408
The test set acts as unseen data for evaluation.
